# prompthangar
===
 PromptHangar is a privacy-first, offline workbench for prompt engineers. Version prompts with Git-style branching, A/B test across 15+ providers, and use smart compression—all with zero telemetry. No accounts; your data stays on your machine. Features include Magic Copy, semantic search, and prompt chains. Professional and free forever.
